  "title": "Unified 4D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "SplatFlux and AEON both present unified approaches to 4D reconstruction and generation, combining video and 3D models to enhance scene realism. SplatFlux uses a feed-forward latent space for both reconstruction and generation, while AEON bridges video and 3D models by integrating 4DGS into both.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "SplatFlux introduces a static-dynamic decoupled 4D Gaussian representation for efficient 4D scene construction.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "AEON combines video and 3D world models through a unified framework, leveraging 4DGS and camera poses.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Both SplatFlux and AEON achieve state-of-the-art performance in 4D reconstruction and generation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
